{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ごきげんよう！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "森平麗心です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いてくださりありがとうございます!!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もおつかれさまです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張っている姿ずっと見てます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな皆さんになんてことないんですけど、\n息抜きになれるようなブログをかきたいな〜、、\nと思って綴りました笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝手に期待を上げてしまった、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まぁ！、私のここ最近の出来事です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしければみてくださいね😊\n見てもらえたら私がうれしいです\n↑\n結局自分得になってる！！？かも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すみません笑。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob5iFJ0c.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近段々寒くなってきましたね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "クリスマスも近づいてきて、ワクワクです🎄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の家のサンタさんは、実はもう来てくれました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早すぎるよ笑〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "プレゼントはなんと〜、もこもこの可愛いパジャマ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずーっとパジャマ欲しくて嬉しかったです☺️\n今度見せてたらいいな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだ私と同じ学生の方は、\n今年良い子にしていましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サンタさん🧑‍🎄皆さんのところにも来ますように🪄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "冬を感じたく、青の洞窟に行ってきました🌟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobSTYjQO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↑\n青!!笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobRS6Bxs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こっちは紫に見える"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は、毎年友達と行ってるんです☺️\n今年は始めて一人でした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "屋台があったんですけどなんと、ビリヤニが売られていました！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "！！！乃木坂パワー〜〜！！！！！？？\nと一人でわーわーしてました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年も行けたら嬉しいな〜と思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！\nとある先輩と写真を撮ったんですけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またいつかのブログで載せますね🙈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はこの辺で！\n明日も一緒に頑張りましょ〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみなさい〜"}], "source": "official"}